WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 9 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.940
It feels so good.

2
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.940
Wait, what the hell am I thinking?

3
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.940
Are you out of your mind, Rabbit?

4
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.940
You're seriously hitting on the old hag?

5
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:17.940
You might break her hip.

6
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.940
Shameless.

7
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.380
Finn! Let's not rush things, okay?

8
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:29.380
Just let my old bones get some peaceful sleep tonight.

9
00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:43.470
Five more minutes, Mom.

10
00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:45.470
It's too early.

11
00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:54.020
Finn.

12
00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:59.230
Sylvia, please don't push me away.

13
00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:04.230
I can't fight like Jax, and I'm not smart like Alistair,

14
00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.230
offering my body to comfort you.

15
00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:10.230
It's the only value I have left.

16
00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:12.230
Finn.

17
00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:14.230
You don't need to prove anything to me.

18
00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:17.230
I made that bond with you three because I wanted to help you,

19
00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:21.230
not because I expect you to please me.

20
00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:25.230
Sylvia, you're nothing like the humans I used to serve.

21
00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:27.230
What, because I'm the oldest and ugliest one?

22
00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:32.230
No. When I look at you, I don't see an old woman.

23
00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:35.230
I see a beautiful, innocent soul.

24
00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:41.600
Honestly, I'm really glad I met you.

25
00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:49.510
So listening is the key to raising the rabbit's affinity.

26
00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:50.510
Okay.

27
00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:55.170
Finn, tell me about your past.

28
00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:59.170
What happened before you ended up in the arena?

29
00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:02.170
My clan used to live deep in the forest.

30
00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:04.170
We were peaceful.

31
00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:09.170
Until that day, the Beast Floak declared war on humanity,

32
00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.170
and we were drafted by force.

33
00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:20.970
After I was captured, they sent me to some human noble as a plaything.

34
00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.970
These scars were from him.

35
00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:27.970
When he got tired of me, he dumped me in the Imperial Coliseum to die.

36
00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:31.700
And then you found me.

37
00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:36.190
You're safe now.

38
00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:39.570
I'll protect you.

39
00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.570
Won't let anyone hurt you ever again.

40
00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:50.330
Then let me truly belong to you.

41
00:02:50.330 --> 00:03:11.370
She knows.

42
00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:30.850
Your Beast Mate's affinity has increased significantly.

43
00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.850
Finn, 30.

44
00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:33.850
Jax, 20.

45
00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:37.540
Alistair, 5.

46
00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:42.540
Unlocking Affinity Milestone Reward, age reversal.
